<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was at a standstill in the panhandle area late Monday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested at the close.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers. 4,500 head confirmed for the week to date.</p>
<p>Confirmed:     None    Week Ago:  None    Year Ago:   None</p>
<p>Wk to Date:   4,500    Week Ago:  None    Year Ago: 62,900</p>
